Eve Arden | 82 | US | Actress | |\\n| November | 13 | Don Chaffey | 73 | New Zealand | Director | |\\n| November | 13 | Maurice Richlin | 70 | US | Screenwriter ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1990_in_film\"}],\"query\":\"Deep Roy Don Chaffey film\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_eec3470c21a345ceadbff4b5"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d74\",\"snippet\":\" ... While he was born with a hormone deficiency, Shah called himself \\\"perfectly formed\\\" even when he \\\"stopped growing.\\\"\\n\\n\\\"Without a great performance the character would neither be convincing nor entertaining to watch,\\\" Star Wars creature effects supervisor Neal Scanlan told CNN. \\\"Kiran brings both of the above.\\\"\\n\\nShah ... \",\"title\":\"https://okmagazine.com/p/shortest-actors-hollywood-verne-troyer-danny-devito/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d61\",\"snippet\":\" ... Kiran Shah\\nhonorific_suffix: GBR MBE 100%\\nbirth_date: 28 09 1956\\nbirth_place: Nairobi, Kenya\\noccupation: Actor, stuntman\\nheight: 4 ft 2 in\\nyearsactive: 1975–present\\n\\nKiran Jethalal Shah (born 28 September 1956) is a Kenyan actor and stunt double.\\n\\nShah was born in Nairobi, Kenya to ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiran_Shah\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d75\",\"snippet\":\" ... Dragon Con Conversations with Kiran Shah!\\ndate: 2006-09-06\\n---\\nCelebriel writes: This year Kiran Shah, noted actor and stuntman who played the scale double for Frodo and other hobbits in The Lord of the Rings, was the Tolkien Tracks celebrity guest. He hosted a Q&A panel ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.theonering.net/torwp/2006/09/06/24074-dragon-con-conversations-with-kiran-shah-2/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\"